                "{what} name: attributes of a multi-valued RelativeDistinguishedName \
                 are not encoded in DER SET OF order (the members must be sorted by \
                 their complete DER encoding bytes: tag, then length, then content)"
            ));
        }
    }
    Ok(())
}

